# A shebang line only works with LF. `core.autocrlf=true` checks these out with
# CRLF on a Windows working copy, and then two things break at once: the kernel
# looks for an interpreter called "node\r", and esbuild refuses the file
# outright — importing any shebang script from a test fails with "Invalid or
# unexpected token" while CI, which checks out LF, stays green.
#
# Measured on src/test/measure-first-load.test.js, 2026-08-22: one suite red on
# Windows and green on Linux, for a file neither had changed.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

public/audio/recitation/**/*.wav binary
